### ============================================
### BOOKING SERVICE - Pruebas de endpoints (vía API Gateway)
### Puerto interno: 3006 | Prefijo gateway: /api/v1/reservas -> /api/v1/bookings
### Base de datos: uajs_bookings (bookings, booking_types, booking_statuses, booking_audit_trail)
### Depende de resource-service (3005) para verificar disponibilidad.
### ============================================

@gateway = http://localhost:3000
@direct = http://localhost:3006
@contentType = application/json
@adminEmail = evidencia.qa@uajs.edu
@adminPassword = EvidenciaQA.2026
@resourceId = 1

### ============================================
### IDs REALES ya existentes en uajs_bookings.bookings.
### Se usan en lugar de {{createReserva.response.body.data.id}} para que cada
### request funcione por sí solo, sin depender de ejecutar antes el POST.
### Estado actual (verificar con la consulta de abajo):
###   @id        -> bk-2026-c28d68af  status 6 completed  (consulta GET)
###   @idFlujo   -> bk-2026-5b5e67ea  status 1 pending    (aprobar -> confirmar -> completar)
###   @idRechazo -> bk-2026-e9752a0b  status 1 pending    (rechazar)
###   @idCancelar-> bk-2026-868cf3b1  status 1 pending    (cancelar)
###   SELECT id, reference_number, title, status_id
###   FROM uajs_bookings.bookings ORDER BY id DESC;
### OJO: las transiciones MUTAN el estado. Si vuelves a ejecutar el archivo
### después de aprobar/confirmar/completar/rechazar/cancelar, esos requests
### responderán 409 ("Cannot transition from ...") porque el estado ya cambió.
### Para reiniciar: recrea las reservas y actualiza estos valores.
### ============================================
@id = 6
@idFlujo = 4
@idRechazo = 5
@idCancelar = 6

### ============================================
### PREREQUISITOS
### 1) SUPERADMIN asignado (ver user-service.http) y LOGIN ejecutado.
### 2) Recurso ACTIVO creado con resource-service.http; reemplazar @resourceId
###    (SELECT id FROM uajs_resources.resources WHERE is_active = 1;).
### 3) El recurso debe tener horario para el DÍA DE LA SEMANA de cada bookingDate y
###    no debe estar bloqueado en esa franja. Si no, el servicio responde
###    409 "Resource is not available: closed_on_this_day" / "outside_operating_hours".
###    Ejemplo para habilitar todos los días de un recurso (0=domingo .. 6=sábado):
###      POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/recursos/recursos/{{resourceId}}/horarios
###      { "dayOfWeek": 2, "openTime": "06:00", "closeTime": "22:00" }
###    OJO: 2026-11-10 es martes (dayOfWeek 2). El tipo AULA (id 1) admite hasta
###    240 minutos y 30 días de antelación.
### 4) Las reservas no se borran: solo se cancelan o rechazan (auditoría).
### ============================================

### HEALTH CHECK
GET {{direct}}/api/v1/bookings/health

### LOGIN
# @name login
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### ============================================
### TIPOS DE RESERVA  (booking_types)
### Semilla: 1 AULA, 2 LABORATORIO, 3 AUDITORIO, 4 EQUIPO
### ============================================

### Listar tipos -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/reservas/tipos?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Crear tipo de prueba -> 201
# @name createTipo
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/reservas/tipos
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "code": "LAB2",
  "name": "LABORATORIO DE CÓMPUTO",
  "description": "Tipo de reserva para laboratorios de cómputo",
  "requiresApproval": true,
  "maxDurationMinutes": 240,
  "advanceDaysLimit": 10
}

### Actualizar tipo -> 200
PUT {{gateway}}/api/v1/reservas/tipos/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "maxDurationMinutes": 90
}

### ============================================
### ESTADOS  (booking_statuses, semilla)
### pending, approved, rejected, confirmed, cancelled, completed
### ============================================

GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/reservas/estados?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### ============================================
### RESERVAS  (bookings)
### Flujo: pending -> approved -> confirmed -> completed
###        pending -> rejected
###        no final -> cancelled (por el solicitante)
### ============================================

### Crear reserva (queda en pending) -> 201
# @name createReserva
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/reservas/reservas
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "bookingTypeId": 1,
  "resourceId": {{resourceId}},
  "title": "Clase de prueba QA",
  "description": "Reserva creada desde pruebas",
  "bookingDate": "2026-11-10",
  "startTime": "09:00",
  "endTime": "11:00",
  "expectedAttendees": 20
}

### Fin anterior al inicio -> 400 (CHECK end_time > start_time)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/reservas/reservas
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "bookingTypeId": 1,
  "resourceId": {{resourceId}},
  "title": "Horario inválido",
  "bookingDate": "2026-11-10",
  "startTime": "11:00",
  "endTime": "09:00"
}

### Duración mayor al máximo del tipo -> 400
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/reservas/reservas
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "bookingTypeId": 1,
  "resourceId": {{resourceId}},
  "title": "Demasiado larga",
  "bookingDate": "2026-11-11",
  "startTime": "08:00",
  "endTime": "15:00"
}

### Listar reservas (filtros statusId, resourceUuid) -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/reservas/reservas?page=1&limit=10&statusId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Obtener reserva -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/reservas/reservas/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Historial de transiciones (booking_audit_trail) -> 200
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/reservas/reservas/{{idFlujo}}/historial
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Aprobar (ADMIN) -> 200 (pending -> approved)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/reservas/reservas/{{idFlujo}}/aprobar
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Confirmar (ADMIN) -> 200 (approved -> confirmed)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/reservas/reservas/{{idFlujo}}/confirmar
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Completar (ADMIN) -> 200 (confirmed -> completed)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/reservas/reservas/{{idFlujo}}/completar
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### ---- Reserva para probar rechazo ----
# @name createReservaRechazo
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/reservas/reservas
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "bookingTypeId": 1,
  "resourceId": {{resourceId}},
  "title": "Reserva para rechazar",
  "bookingDate": "2026-11-10",
  "startTime": "14:00",
  "endTime": "16:00"
}

### Rechazar sin motivo -> 400 (reason min 3)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/reservas/reservas/{{idRechazo}}/rechazar
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "reason": ""
}

### Rechazar con motivo (ADMIN) -> 200 (estado final rejected)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/reservas/reservas/{{idRechazo}}/rechazar
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "reason": "Sala reservada para mantenimiento"
}

### ---- Reserva para probar cancelación por el solicitante ----
# @name createReservaCancelar
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/reservas/reservas
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "bookingTypeId": 1,
  "resourceId": {{resourceId}},
  "title": "Reserva para cancelar",
  "bookingDate": "2026-11-12",
  "startTime": "10:00",
  "endTime": "11:00"
}

### Cancelar con motivo (solicitante) -> 200
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/reservas/reservas/{{idCancelar}}/cancelar
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "reason": "Cambio de planes"
}

### Sin token -> 401
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/reservas/reservas

### ============================================
### LIMPIEZA
### Las reservas no se borran (tienen auditoría). Solo se elimina el tipo de prueba,
### que no tiene reservas asociadas.
### ============================================
DELETE {{gateway}}/api/v1/reservas/tipos/{{createTipo.response.body.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### ============================================
### VERIFICACIÓN EN BD
### SELECT id, reference_number, status_id, requester_uuid, resource_uuid FROM uajs_bookings.bookings ORDER BY id DESC LIMIT 5;
### SELECT booking_id, from_status_id, to_status_id, actor_name, occurred_at FROM uajs_bookings.booking_audit_trail ORDER BY id DESC LIMIT 10;


